#
# Human steps (all human-performed):
#   1. copy the draft to  <this dir>/.github/workflows/test.yml
#   2. verify:  cd <this dir> && shasum -a 256 -c MANIFEST.sha256   (must say OK)
#   3. apply the staged candidate to the live .github/workflows/test.yml
#   4. confirm branch protection still requires [test, cli-hook-enforcement]
#
# Until step 3 lands, this PR's CI cannot run the three new suites Streams A/B
# and Stream D's own self-check register -- that red state is the designed
# fail-closed behaviour (design.md Deployment / CI Plan; TEST-020 DESIGNED-RED),
# not a defect.
#
